---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Faq from '../components/Faq.astro';
import { CONTACT_FAQ, faqSchema } from '../data/site';
---
<Base
  title='Book a Free AI Strategy Session | Roadmap Labs'
  description='Book a free 1-hour AI strategy session with Dan Kovac. Talk through your bottlenecks and goals, and get a custom report within 48 hours. No cost, no lock-in.'
  path="/contact"
  schema={[faqSchema(CONTACT_FAQ)]}
>

<section class="ev-pad" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 24px; box-sizing: border-box">
  <div class="rl-split" style="align-items: start">
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 24px">
      <span class="rl-tag">Free AI strategy session</span>
      <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(44px, 5.6vw, 68px); line-height: 1.02; letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-weight: 500">A free hour on where AI fits in your business</h1>
      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 30px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; color: var(--text-secondary); max-width: 30em">Bring your bottlenecks and your goals. We'll work through them with you and suggest where AI fits, using the systems you already run on. There's no risk in the conversation.</p>
      <ul class="ev-checklist">
        <li><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.8 2.8L16 10"/></svg><span><strong style="font-weight: 600">Your bottlenecks.</strong> <span style="color: var(--text-secondary)">Where the time and money go, and what's holding the business back.</span></span></li>
        <li><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.8 2.8L16 10"/></svg><span><strong style="font-weight: 600">Your goals.</strong> <span style="color: var(--text-secondary)">Where you want the business to be, and what AI can realistically do to get it there.</span></span></li>
        <li><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.8 2.8L16 10"/></svg><span><strong style="font-weight: 600">Our suggestions.</strong> <span style="color: var(--text-secondary)">The AI providers, tools and automations that suit a business like yours.</span></span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="rl-signal" style="padding: 32px; min-height: 0; position: relative; overflow: hidden">
      <h2 style="margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 22px; line-height: 30px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; font-weight: 600">Book your free session</h2>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 20px">Leave your details and Dan will be in touch to find a time.</p>
      <div class="rl-card form-thanks" id="contact-thanks" tabindex="-1" role="status" hidden style="width: 100%; color: var(--ink); box-shadow: var(--shadow-float)">
        <h3>Thanks, Dan will be in touch to find a time.</h3>
        <p>Your details are on their way. If anything's urgent, email <a href="mailto:dan@roadmaplabs.com.au">dan@roadmaplabs.com.au</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <form class="rl-card" id="contact-form" action="https://formspree.io/f/xdeeekqw" method="POST" style="width: 100%; display: grid; gap: 16px; color: var(--ink); box-shadow: var(--shadow-float)">
        <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New session enquiry from the Roadmap Labs website">
        <div><label class="rl-label" for="c-name">Name</label><input class="rl-input" id="c-name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required style="width: 100%"></div>
        <div><label class="rl-label" for="c-email">Email</label><input class="rl-input" id="c-email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required style="width: 100%"></div>
        <div><label class="rl-label" for="c-phone">Phone</label><input class="rl-input" id="c-phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" required style="width: 100%"></div>
        <div><label class="rl-label" for="c-site">Business website<span style="font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-secondary)"> (optional)</span></label><input class="rl-input" id="c-site" name="website" type="text" inputmode="url" placeholder="yourbusiness.com.au" style="width: 100%"></div>
        <div><label class="rl-label" for="c-notes">Tell us a bit about your business<span style="font-weight: 400; color: var(--text-secondary)"> (optional)</span></label><textarea class="rl-input" id="c-notes" name="notes" rows="4" style="width: 100%; resize: vertical"></textarea></div>
        <div style="position: absolute; left: -9999px" aria-hidden="true"><label for="c-gotcha">Leave this empty</label><input id="c-gotcha" name="_gotcha" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></div>
        <button class="rl-btn rl-btn--lg" type="submit" style="justify-content: center; margin-top: 0">Book my free session</button>
        <p class="form-status form-status--error" id="contact-error" role="alert" hidden>That didn't send. Please try again, or email <a href="mailto:dan@roadmaplabs.com.au" style="color: inherit">dan@roadmaplabs.com.au</a>.</p>
        <span style="font-size: 12px; line-height: 18px; color: var(--text-muted)">Free, with no lock-in. We only use your details to reply to you. See our <a href="/privacy" style="color: inherit">privacy policy</a>.</span>
      </form>
      <script is:inline>
        (function () {
          var form = document.getElementById('contact-form');
          var thanks = document.getElementById('contact-thanks');
          var error = document.getElementById('contact-error');
          if (!form || !window.fetch) return;
          form.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {
            e.preventDefault();
            var btn = form.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');
            var label = btn.textContent;
            btn.disabled = true;
            btn.textContent = 'Sending…';
            error.hidden = true;
            fetch(form.action, { method: 'POST', body: new FormData(form), headers: { Accept: 'application/json' } })
              .then(function (r) {
                if (!r.ok) throw new Error('Status ' + r.status);
                form.hidden = true;
                thanks.hidden = false;
                thanks.focus();
              })
              .catch(function () {
                btn.disabled = false;
                btn.textContent = label;
                error.hidden = false;
              });
          });
        })();
      </script>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="background: var(--fog)">
  <div class="ev-pad" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 24px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 40px">
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; max-width: 760px">
      <span class="ev-eyebrow">After the session</span>
      <h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 48px); line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.025em; font-weight: 500">A custom report within 48 hours, and no pressure</h2>
    </div>
    <ol style="margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(280px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 32px 48px">
      <li style="border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); padding-top: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
        <span style="font: 600 20px/28px var(--font-sans); letter-spacing: -0.01em">Your custom report</span>
        <span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: var(--text-secondary)">Your business mapped, the automations that suit you, and what each one saves over 12 months.</span>
      </li>
      <li style="border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); padding-top: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
        <span style="font: 600 20px/28px var(--font-sans); letter-spacing: -0.01em">You pick what to build</span>
        <span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: var(--text-secondary)">Choose the automations worth doing. We build them on top of the systems you already have, test them and train your team.</span>
      </li>
      <li style="border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); padding-top: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
        <span style="font: 600 20px/28px var(--font-sans); letter-spacing: -0.01em">Then it's your call</span>
        <span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: var(--text-secondary)">Keep us on an optional retainer to keep it all running and find new opportunities, or manage it yourself. There's no lock-in.</span>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="ev-pad" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 24px; box-sizing: border-box">
  <div class="rl-split">
    <div class="ev-report">
      <div class="rl-ui">
        <div class="rl-ui__row"><span class="rl-ui__meta">Your custom report</span><span class="rl-pill rl-pill--quiet">Example</span></div>
        <div style="font: 600 20px/28px var(--font-sans); letter-spacing: -0.015em">Ready within 48 hours</div>
        <div class="ev-report__checks">
          <span><svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#60646c" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg>Your business mapped</span>
          <span><svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#60646c" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg>Automations that suit you</span>
          <span><svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#60646c" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg>A 12-month value on each one</span>
        </div>
        <div style="display: grid; gap: 4px"><div class="rl-ui__row"><span>1. Quote follow-ups</span><span class="rl-pill">Top value</span></div><div class="rl-bar rl-bar--signal"><i style="width: 92%"></i></div></div>
        <div style="display: grid; gap: 4px"><div class="rl-ui__row"><span>2. Building proposals</span></div><div class="rl-bar rl-bar--signal"><i style="width: 64%"></i></div></div>
        <div style="display: grid; gap: 4px"><div class="rl-ui__row"><span>3. Data entry</span></div><div class="rl-bar rl-bar--signal"><i style="width: 41%"></i></div></div>
        <span class="rl-ui__meta">Ranked by what each saves over 12 months</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h2>Why bring in an outside partner</h2>
      <p>When you're running the business, it's hard to see the systems and processes that need building, let alone find the time to get them done right.</p>
      <p>We take the time to understand how your business actually works before we suggest anything. We've built these systems before, we know where they go wrong, and the roadmap is all we're focused on.</p>
      <a class="rl-link-action" href="/work">See the work</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="border-top: 1px solid var(--border)">
  <div class="ev-pad" style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 24px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 48px">
    <h2 style="flex: 1 1 280px; margin: 0; font-size: 36px; line-height: 1.21; letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-weight: 500">About the session</h2>
    <Faq items={CONTACT_FAQ} openFirst />
  </div>
</section>

</Base>
